{"id":1268,"date":"2022-06-27T17:48:59","date_gmt":"2022-06-27T21:48:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/weddings\/"},"modified":"2024-07-14T10:45:14","modified_gmt":"2024-07-14T14:45:14","slug":"weddings","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/services\/weddings\/","title":{"rendered":"Weddings"},"content":{"rendered":"<section id=\"page-block-block_be0d67dba895424850277041b4870b16\" class=\"acf-block block-lead-text\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-10 col-xl-8 mx-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-lead-text__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><h2>IT\u2019S NOT A RAFANELLI WEDDING. IT\u2019S\u202f<em>YOUR\u202f<\/em>WEDDING. YOUR STORY.<\/h2>\n<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Elevating Your Most Cherished Moments<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With a meticulous eye for detail and a passion for perfection, we orchestrate every aspect of your special day, no matter the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/services\/destination-2\/\">destination<\/a>, ensuring it is as seamless as it is spectacular.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Unparalleled Expertise and Coordination<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/press\/\">expertise in wedding planning is unmatched<\/a>, honed over years of creating flawless celebrations. From the initial consultation to the final send-off, we coordinate every detail with precision. We navigate the complexities of wedding logistics, no matter the destination, with grace and professionalism, allowing you to savor every moment stress-free.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Creating Emotional and Visual Spectacles<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We specialize in transforming venues <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/services\/destination-2\/\">across the globe<\/a> into breathtaking landscapes that reflect your personal style and love story. Our design team works tirelessly to create settings that not only dazzle but also evoke strong emotional responses. Every floral arrangement, lighting cue, and decor choice is meticulously planned to create a cohesive and stunning atmosphere.<\/p>\n\n\n<section id=\"page-block-block_af0f4a55a948b1e1671f3839124373d4\" class=\"acf-block block-img-comp\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row fluid-half\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"aspectratio ratio-16x9\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"630\" height=\"788\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-630x788.jpg\" class=\"attachment-standard-width-block size-standard-width-block\" alt=\"An elegant outdoor event venue space with floral decorations hanging from the ceiling, arranged tables with blue accents, and transparent tent walls.\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-630x788.jpg 630w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-818x1024.jpg 818w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-1227x1536.jpg 1227w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-1637x2048.jpg 1637w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-483x605.jpg 483w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set-798x999.jpg 798w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/bright-greenhouse-blue-dining-set.jpg 1643w\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"aspectratio ratio-16x9\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"630\" height=\"473\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/\u00a9michellebeller2022_086-1-630x473.jpg\" class=\"attachment-standard-width-block size-standard-width-block\" alt=\"Dramatic wedding reception under a canopy of beautiful white florals. Designed by Rafanelli Events.\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/\u00a9michellebeller2022_086-1-630x473.jpg 630w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/\u00a9michellebeller2022_086-1-1365x1024.jpg 1365w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/\u00a9michellebeller2022_086-1-807x605.jpg 807w, https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/\u00a9michellebeller2022_086-1-850x638.jpg 850w\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exclusive Vendor Partnerships<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We collaborate with only the finest vendors worldwide in the industry, from world-class caterers to renowned florists and entertainers. Our selective partnerships ensure that every aspect of your wedding is handled by experts who share our commitment to excellence and attention to detail.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A Day to Remember<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On your wedding day, we promise a pause in time\u2014a moment where everything aligns perfectly, capturing the essence of your love and commitment. As you step into the celebration, the world fades away, leaving only the joy of the occasion. It\u2019s not just about the magic of the day but making that magic tangible, memorable, and uniquely yours.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your wedding with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rafanellievents.com\/team\/\">Rafanelli Events<\/a> is more than an event; it\u2019s the beginning of a beautiful new chapter. Let us help you turn the page with elegance, joy, and unforgettable moments that will last a lifetime.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Services<\/h2>\n\n\n\t<section id=\"page-block-block_046b05df9014e2d0e87c2b70a7d23a4c\" class=\"acf-block block-grid-columns\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-lg-8 col-md-10 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid-columns__column col-12 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>\nArrival Gifts<\/li>\n<li>Destination Wedding Location Selection<\/li>\n<li>Bridal Salon Selection<\/li>\n<li>Budget Planning<\/li>\n<li>Catering Consultation<\/li>\n<li>D\u00e9cor Selection<\/li>\n<li>Engagement Parties<\/li>\n<li>Entertainment<\/li>\n<li>Etiquette Advice<\/li>\n<li>Favors<\/li>\n<li>Floral<\/li>\n<li>Hair and Makeup<\/li>\n<li>Hotel Room Blocks<\/li>\n<li>Invitations<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid-columns__column col-12 col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Itineraries<\/li>\n<li>Lighting and Sound<\/li>\n<li>Officiants<\/li>\n<li>On-Site Management<\/li>\n<li>Photography<\/li>\n<li>Rehearsal Dinners<\/li>\n<li>Rentals<\/li>\n<li>Stationery<\/li>\n<li>Tenting<\/li>\n<li>Timelines<\/li>\n<li>Transportation<\/li>\n<li>Guest Experiences<\/li>\n<li>Videography<\/li>\n<li>Wedding Cake<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n\n\t<section id=\"page-block-block_b44003972d83d06a6a2cfbff54744fa7\" class=\"acf-block block-slider-gallery lightbox-gallery block-slider-gallery--hard\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div